            "pricing.faq.creditsHow.question": "What are credits and how do they work?",
            "pricing.faq.creditsHow.answer": "Credits are Converge AI's unified currency used across all our products, including Enter, Framia, and more. The amount consumed varies by task complexity and the model used.",
            "pricing.faq.paymentMethodsDetailed.question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "pricing.faq.paymentMethodsDetailed.answer": "We accept all major credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex) and Alipay, all processed via Stripe.",
            "pricing.faq.workspaceSubscription.question": "Who does my subscription apply to?",
            "pricing.faq.workspaceSubscription.answer": "Your subscription applies to the entire workspace, not your personal account. Everyone in the workspace shares the same credits and gets access to all connected Converge products — including Enter, Framia, and more — under one workspace plan. If you manage multiple workspaces, each one needs its own subscription.",
            "pricing.faq.discountEligibility.question": "When does my workspace qualify for a discounted first month?",
            "pricing.faq.discountEligibility.answer": "New workspaces may qualify for a first-month discount depending on the plan. For Basic, the discount is tied to the workspace Owner — it applies only if the Owner has never used a Basic first-month discount before, across any workspace. For Pro, the discount is tied to the workspace itself — it applies as long as that workspace has never been subscribed to that Pro tier before. Ultimate does not include a first-month discount.",
            "pricing.faq.outOfCreditsDetailed.question": "What happens if my workspace runs out of credits?",
            "pricing.faq.outOfCreditsDetailed.answer": "For free workspaces, subscribe to a plan to continue. For paid workspaces, you can top up or upgrade to a higher plan for a larger monthly allowance.",
            "pricing.faq.planVsTopUpCredits.question": "What's the difference between plan credits and top-up credits?",
            "pricing.faq.planVsTopUpCredits.answer": "Your workspace plan includes a monthly credit allowance that resets each billing cycle. Top-up credits are purchased separately, are valid for one year from the date of purchase, and are non-refundable.",
            "pricing.faq.multipleWorkspaces.question": "Can I have multiple workspaces?",
            "pricing.faq.multipleWorkspaces.answer": "Yes. You can create multiple workspaces, each with its own plan, credit balance, and member list.",
            "pricing.faq.subProductFeatures.question": "Do sub-product features depend on my plan?",
            "pricing.faq.subProductFeatures.answer": "Yes. Sub-product privileges across connected Converge products — such as AI features, watermark removal, GitHub sync, and collaboration tools — are tied to your workspace plan. One workspace plan covers all connected products.",
            "pricing.faq.memberLeaves.question": "What happens to credits when a member leaves the workspace?",
            "pricing.faq.memberLeaves.answer": "Credits stay in the workspace. Members do not take any credits with them when they leave or are removed.",
            "pricing.faq.manageBilling.question": "Where can I manage my subscription and billing?",
            "pricing.faq.manageBilling.answer": "Go to Workspace Settings → Plan & Billings. From there you can cancel your subscription (your workspace plan stays active until the end of the current billing period), view payment history, and download invoices.",
            "pricing.compare.descriptionFramiaPublic": "Framia is the creative AI Agent with automated workflow canvas and marketing skills to deliver pro-level AI content.",
